WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.975
Module 4 is coexistence,
migration and retirement.

2
00:00:03.975 --> 00:00:08.988
Coexistence isn't the last phase; it's
the condition the whole project runs in.

3
00:00:08.988 --> 00:00:12.123
For most of the migration
both PKIs are production,

4
00:00:12.123 --> 00:00:16.970
and the plan has to say which one each
certificate comes from, and how to go back.
